{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14362","headline":"清如玉壶冰 · 潘炎","name":"清如玉壶冰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"琰玉性惟坚，成壶体更圆。\n虚心含景象，应物受寒泉。\n温润资天质，清贞禀自然。\n日融光乍散，雪照色逾鲜。\n至鉴功宁宰，无私照岂偏。\n明将冰镜对，白与粉花连。\n拂拭终爲美，提携伫见传。\n勿令毫髪累，遗恨鲍公篇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"潘炎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14362.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14362","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}